From 93c867d2554831f35d1be8af00072513514e889a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Robin Roloff <robinroloff04@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 13:52:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Execute RemoveNodeAggregate as a soft removal in Neos 9.2
 workspaces

Neos 9.2 dropped the removal attachment point, so a hard removal in a
workspace can no longer be scoped to a site or document when publishing.
Dispatch TagSubtree(removed) instead, as the Neos UI does; root workspaces
and Neos 9.1 keep the hard removal. Not merged: pending discussion, see
Medienreaktor.NeosStudio Documentation.
